{"version":1,"content":"<p>由3位母親支嚳儀（Venus）、賴慰玲（Winki）及陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）主持的親子旅遊節目《玩住學。</p><p>學住玩》，今晚（22日）Winki同囝囝梁進也（也也）跟一班小朋友上堂。</p><p>也也講到課堂體會，直言較香港來得自由，他笑說︰「可以傾偈，喺香港可以咁就正喇。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:03.193063+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:45:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:17:55.424799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:26.161716+00:00","content_hash":"9f9b284afbaf000e26f07c77a46fbcfb28bbe31068d3ca96c1575e44cfaec196","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}